      "value": " <p>Arts University Bournemouth has accommodation available for first-year students in a great range of residence halls located on AUB Campus and in the Lansdowne area of Bournemouth town centre. Modern self-contained studio flats, traditional en-suite rooms in cluster flats, and traditional shared accommodation are all options open to students.</p><p>Student Advisers help with advice and queries surrounding moving in.</p>",
